    "secondaryRisks": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "the-rebuild-was-not-the-only-question-the-remaining-injectors-were-a-ticking-time-bomb",
          "title": "The rebuild was not the only question. The remaining injectors were a ticking time bomb.",
          "description": "With one injector tip failed, the other three were of the same age and batch. If another tip detached, the engine would need another rebuild. The specialist recommended replacing all four.",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h3",
              "id": "",
              "text": "Path A"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Rebuild only the damaged cylinder — re-bore cylinder three, one oversize piston, leave other three cylinders and existing injectors."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£2,500"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "If another injector fails later: add £1,500–£2,500 for another rebuild."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "level": "h3",
              "id": "",
              "text": "Path B"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Full rebuild — all four cylinders re-bored, four oversize pistons, new rings, bearings, full set of new injectors."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "£4,000"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Eliminates risk of future injector failure. Expected life: 200,000+ miles."
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/case-studies/assets/5.1-toyota-hilux-1kd-injector-set-risk.png",
              "alt": "Toyota 1KD-FTV injector set diagram showing risk of remaining injectors failing",
              "width": "",
              "height": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "The owner chose Path B. For a Hilux intended to last another 200,000 miles, doing the job properly once made more sense than cutting corners. Key takeaway: when one injector fails catastrophically, replace all four."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Fork in the road"
            }
          ],
          "links": [],
          "source": {
            "sectionId": "the-rebuild-was-not-the-only-question-the-remaining-injectors-were-a-ticking-time-bomb",
            "order": 5
          }
        }
      ]
    },
